### HTTP Client (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ). Jalankan server dulu: npm start
@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Login mahasiswa (Budi)
# @name loginBudi
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "budi", "password": "Budi#2026" }

###
@tokenBudi = {{loginBudi.response.body.data.token}}

### 2. Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin#2026" }

###
@tokenAdmin = {{loginAdmin.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Login password salah -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "budi", "password": "salah" }

### 4. Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{host}}/api/pengaduan

### 5. Mahasiswa membuat pengaduan -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "AC ruang kelas C101 mati", "kategori": "Fasilitas", "deskripsi": "AC di ruang C101 tidak dingin sehingga ruangan terasa sangat panas." }

### 6. Mahasiswa melihat pengaduan sendiri -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/pengaduan/1
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}

### 7. Mahasiswa melihat pengaduan orang lain -> 403
GET {{host}}/api/pengaduan/2
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}

### 8. Mahasiswa mengubah status -> 403
PATCH {{host}}/api/pengaduan/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "selesai" }

### 9. Admin melihat semua -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

### 10. Admin memperbarui status -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/api/pengaduan/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "diproses" }

### 11. Field wajib kosong -> 400
POST {{host}}/api/pengaduan
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "judul": "", "kategori": "Fasilitas", "deskripsi": "" }

### 12. ID tidak ditemukan -> 404
GET {{host}}/api/pengaduan/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenBudi}}
